#1522
prisoner gnome~
a gnome prisoner~
A gnome prisoner is here resting in the straw.
~
The prisoner is just barely alive.
~
7 0 0 S
3 17 8 3d5+10 2d3+1
1 0
0 0 1
>speech_prog gnome village help work prisoner child~
if rand(50)
mpecho The gnome man says 'On my way to work. The work is mostly not dying. It pays in not dying.'
else
mpecho The gnome prisoner whispers 'The hobgoblins took the deep tunnels. Watch the king's bodyguard before the king.'
endif
~
>speech_prog escape guard boss key way exit~
if rand(17)
mpecho $I whispers 'The loud ones know less than the beaten ones. Watch the guards, not their mouths.'
else
if rand(20)
mpecho $I whispers 'If a room hates recall, believe it. I learned that the slow way.'
else
if rand(25)
mpecho $I whispers 'Free me or don't, but if you free the wrong thing, run first and apologize never.'
else
if rand(33)
mpecho $I whispers 'I've counted the guard's steps for a year. He limps on the left. Make of that what you will.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I whispers 'They keep the real keys on the one who never speaks. Funny how that works.'
else
mpecho $I whispers 'Hope is a luxury down here. So is a name. Take what I tell you and go.'
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
~
