#1524
hermit crab~
a hermit~
A hermit crab crawls towards you.
~
The hermit crab is about 5 feet high and looks mad that you had the nerve
to wake it up.
~
39 0 0 S
5 16 5 1d11+61 1d8+0
200 0
0 0 1
>speech_prog herb forest nature path woods heal hermit~
if rand(17)
mpecho $I says 'Herbs grow where blood has not yet ruined the soil. That narrows it down. Barely.'
else
if rand(20)
mpecho $I says 'If the trees go quiet, something is hunting. Probably you.'
else
if rand(25)
mpecho $I says 'I left the cities because people there talk too much. And here you are. Talking.'
else
if rand(33)
mpecho $I says 'Nature is balance. The bear eats you, the worms eat the bear, I eat neither and live longer.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I says 'Lost? The path's right there. It's always right there. People just stop looking down.'
else
mpecho $I mutters to a plant, listens to its answer, and seems more satisfied with that conversation than this one.
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
~
|
#1526
cook hobgoblin~
the cook~
A hobgoblin cook stands here cooking something.
~
The cook is a dirty and fat hobgoblin.  He burps as he stirs up something
in a pot.
~
7 0 0 S
7 14 4 1d12+85 1d7+1
2600 0
0 0 1
>speech_prog rest sleep room drink food rumor inn tavern~
if rand(14)
mpecho $I says 'Rest before the road. The road never rests before you.'
else
if rand(17)
mpecho $I says 'Drink, sleep, or leave. Bleeding on the floor is none of those.'
else
if rand(20)
mpecho $I says 'Heroes who forget to stand up before walking out die in my doorway. Don't.'
else
if rand(25)
mpecho $I says 'The stew is brown. Don't ask what kind of brown. The brave don't ask.'
else
if rand(33)
mpecho $I says 'Room's upstairs, ale's downstairs, regret's wherever you left it. Enjoy your stay.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I says 'I've heard every adventurer's life story twice. Tip well and I'll pretend yours is new.'
else
mpecho $I polishes a mug that was clean an hour ago and will be clean an hour from now.
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
~
